---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import StaffNavigation from '../../../components/StaffNavigation.astro';
import '../../../styles/admin.css';
import '../../../styles/volunteers.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="志愿者与分工｜ARTDiCO HOST" description="工作人员核对志愿者回复、可服务时段、岗位班次与人手缺额。">
  <div class="ah-admin volunteer-app" data-volunteer-app>
    <header class="ah-admin-header"><a class="ah-admin-brand" href="/admin/">ARTDiCO <span>HOST</span></a><a class="ah-admin-back" href="https://artdico.host">查看活动页面 ↗</a></header>
    <main class="ah-admin-main" id="main-content">
      <p class="ah-admin-status" data-volunteer-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
      <section class="ah-admin-login-card" data-volunteer-login-panel aria-labelledby="volunteer-login-title"><h1 id="volunteer-login-title">志愿者与分工</h1><p class="ah-admin-intro">用现有工作人员账号登录。此页需要管理员，或同时具备人员邀约与报名审核权限。</p><form method="post" data-volunteer-login><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-user">用户名或邮箱</label><input id="volunteer-user" name="username" autocomplete="username" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="160" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-password">密码</label><input id="volunteer-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="1024" required /></div><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-volunteer-login-submit type="submit" disabled>登录工作区</button></form></section>
      <section class="ah-admin-workspace-layout" data-volunteer-workspace hidden>
        <StaffNavigation current="volunteers" />
        <div class="ah-admin-workspace-content">
          <div class="ah-admin-page-heading"><div><h1 tabindex="-1" data-volunteer-heading>志愿者与分工</h1><p data-volunteer-event>沿用同一份人员资料，分别核对志愿回复、参会名额和班次。</p></div><div class="volunteer-account"><span data-volunteer-user></span><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-refresh>重新读取</button><button class="ah-admin-text-button" type="button" data-volunteer-logout>退出登录</button></div></div>
          <p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-denied hidden>此账号需要管理员权限，或同时具备人员邀约与报名审核权限。没有读取名单或排班资料。</p>
          <div data-volunteer-authorized hidden>
            <div class="volunteer-pending" data-volunteer-pending hidden><strong>操作结果尚待确认</strong><p data-volunteer-pending-message>填写内容仍保留。请确认同一操作结果，避免重复新增或覆盖。</p><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-retry>再次确认同一操作</button></div>
            <p class="volunteer-note volunteer-source-warning" data-volunteer-source-warning hidden></p>
            <details class="volunteer-guide"><summary>如何安排志愿者</summary><ol><li>从现有人員或报名中选择一人，保留原意向及报名。</li><li>记录本人协作回复、负责同事和可服务时段。</li><li>建立岗位及班次，填每班所需人手。</li><li>核对时间及参会名额后确认排班，再检查缺额。</li></ol><p>加入名单不会自动登记参会、占用额外名额或发出邀请。志愿者同样计入整场 300 人上限。</p></details>
            <div class="volunteer-metrics" data-volunteer-metrics aria-label="志愿者及班次概况"></div>
            <nav class="volunteer-section-links" aria-label="志愿者区块"><a href="#volunteer-roster-title">名单与沟通</a><a href="#volunteer-shifts-title">班次与缺额</a><a href="#volunteer-positions-title">岗位</a></nav>
            <section class="ah-admin-panel" aria-labelledby="volunteer-roster-title"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="volunteer-roster-title">名单与沟通</h2><p>本人协作回复与正式参会名额分别保存。人数按明确人员身份去重。</p></div><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="button" data-volunteer-add>从现有名单添加</button></div>
              <form class="volunteer-filters" data-volunteer-filters><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-query">姓名、机构或负责同事</label><input id="volunteer-query" name="query" type="search" maxlength="200" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-workflow-filter">协作回复</label><select id="volunteer-workflow-filter" name="status"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="pending">待联系</option><option value="invited">已记录邀约，待回复</option><option value="confirmed">本人已答应</option><option value="declined">本人婉拒</option><option value="inactive">已停止参与</option></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-assignment-filter">分工安排</label><select id="volunteer-assignment-filter" name="assignment"><option value="">全部安排</option><option value="unassigned">尚未安排</option><option value="assigned">已有安排</option><option value="issues">需核对</option></select></div><button class="ah-admin-button" type="submit">应用筛选</button><button class="ah-admin-text-button" type="reset">清除</button></form>
              <p class="volunteer-result" data-volunteer-result-count></p><div class="ah-admin-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="志愿者名单，可水平滚动"><table><thead><tr><th>人员</th><th>沟通与负责同事</th><th>可服务时间</th><th>参会名额</th><th>分工与待核对</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody data-volunteer-roster></tbody></table></div><p class="ah-admin-empty" data-volunteer-roster-empty hidden>目前没有符合筛选的志愿者。选择已保存人员后，可开始记录协作与安排。</p>
              <div class="volunteer-export"><label><input type="checkbox" data-volunteer-export-contact />确有工作需要，包含邮箱／微信／电话</label><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-export>导出当前筛选 Excel</button><p class="volunteer-note">默认导出最小名单、岗位与排班，不含原始问卷。导出留审计，不创建公开链接。</p></div>
            </section>
            <section class="ah-admin-panel" aria-labelledby="volunteer-shifts-title"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="volunteer-shifts-title">班次与缺额</h2><p>需求、已确认及缺额按班次人次计算；同一人跨班不会重复计入志愿者总人数。</p></div><div class="volunteer-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-add-shift>新增班次</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="button" data-volunteer-add-assignment>安排志愿者</button></div></div><div class="ah-admin-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="岗位班次与缺额，可水平滚动"><table><thead><tr><th>岗位／区域</th><th>时间与关联活动</th><th>需求</th><th>拟安排</th><th>已确认</th><th>缺额</th><th>人员与操作</th></tr></thead><tbody data-volunteer-shifts></tbody></table></div><p class="ah-admin-empty" data-volunteer-shifts-empty hidden>先建立岗位，再按实际需要新增班次和需求人手。</p></section>
            <section class="ah-admin-panel" aria-labelledby="volunteer-positions-title"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="volunteer-positions-title">岗位</h2><p>填写实际工作地点、负责同事与任务说明。停用保留历史。</p></div><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-add-position>新增岗位</button></div><div class="volunteer-position-grid" data-volunteer-positions></div><p class="ah-admin-empty" data-volunteer-positions-empty hidden>还没有岗位。可按实际需要建立签到、舞台、展区或其他岗位。</p></section>
            <p class="volunteer-note volunteer-revision" data-volunteer-revision></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main><footer class="ah-admin-footer"><span>ARTDiCO HOST</span><p>名单、名额、协作回复和排班分别核对。</p><a href="/admin/contacts/">人员与邀约</a></footer>
  </div>

  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog volunteer-dialog" data-volunteer-person-dialog aria-labelledby="volunteer-person-title"><div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><h2 id="volunteer-person-title">添加志愿者</h2><button class="ah-admin-icon-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="person" aria-label="关闭志愿者编辑">×</button></div><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-person-error role="alert" hidden></p>
    <div data-volunteer-source-picker><form class="volunteer-source-search" data-volunteer-source-search><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-source-query">查找现有人员</label><input id="volunteer-source-query" name="query" type="search" maxlength="200" /></div><button class="ah-admin-button" type="submit">查找</button></form><p class="volunteer-note" data-volunteer-source-status role="status"></p><button class="ah-admin-text-button" type="button" data-volunteer-source-next hidden>载入更多人员</button></div>
    <form data-volunteer-person-form><input name="id" type="hidden" /><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-source">现有人员／报名</label><select id="volunteer-source" name="source" required><option value="">请选择一位已保存人员</option></select><small>通过内部编号关联，不按同名合并，不复制或创建另一份报名。</small></div><p class="volunteer-note" data-volunteer-person-source></p><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-workflow">本人协作回复</label><select id="volunteer-workflow" name="workflowStatus"><option value="pending">待联系</option><option value="invited">已记录邀约，待回复</option><option value="confirmed">本人已答应</option><option value="declined">本人婉拒</option><option value="inactive">已停止参与</option></select><small>只记录实际沟通结果；此处保存不会发出邀请或邮件。</small></div><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-owner">负责同事</label><input id="volunteer-owner" name="owner" maxlength="120" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-follow-up">下次跟进日期</label><input id="volunteer-follow-up" name="followUpAt" type="date" /></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-last-contact">上次联系日期</label><input id="volunteer-last-contact" name="lastContactAt" type="date" /></div><fieldset class="volunteer-availability"><legend>活动当天可服务时间</legend><p class="volunteer-note">按本人提供的时间填写；尚未确认可留空，安排班次前需先填写。班次不可超出这些时段。</p><div data-volunteer-availability></div><button class="ah-admin-text-button" type="button" data-volunteer-add-availability>＋ 添加可服务时段</button></fieldset><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-notes">内部沟通备注</label><textarea id="volunteer-notes" name="notes" maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></div><p class="volunteer-form-state" data-volunteer-person-dirty role="status">修改后请保存到云端。</p><div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="person">关闭</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">保存</button></div></form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog volunteer-dialog" data-volunteer-position-dialog aria-labelledby="volunteer-position-title"><div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><h2 id="volunteer-position-title">岗位资料</h2><button class="ah-admin-icon-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="position" aria-label="关闭岗位编辑">×</button></div><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-position-error role="alert" hidden></p><form data-volunteer-position-form><input name="id" type="hidden" /><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-name">岗位名称</label><input id="volunteer-position-name" name="name" maxlength="120" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-zone">区域</label><select id="volunteer-position-zone" name="zone"><option value="A">A 区</option><option value="B">B 区</option><option value="C">C 区</option><option value="other">其他区域</option></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-location">具体工作地点</label><input id="volunteer-position-location" name="location" maxlength="160" /></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-lead">负责同事／组长</label><input id="volunteer-position-lead" name="lead" maxlength="120" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-description">工作说明</label><textarea id="volunteer-position-description" name="description" maxlength="1000" rows="4"></textarea></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-position-status">岗位状态</label><select id="volunteer-position-status" name="status"><option value="active">使用中</option><option value="inactive">已停用，保留历史</option></select></div><p class="volunteer-form-state" data-volunteer-position-dirty role="status">修改后请保存到云端。</p><div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="position">关闭</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">保存</button></div></form></dialog>
  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog volunteer-dialog" data-volunteer-shift-dialog aria-labelledby="volunteer-shift-title"><div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><h2 id="volunteer-shift-title">班次与需求</h2><button class="ah-admin-icon-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="shift" aria-label="关闭班次编辑">×</button></div><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-shift-error role="alert" hidden></p><form data-volunteer-shift-form><input name="id" type="hidden" /><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-position">岗位</label><select id="volunteer-shift-position" name="positionId" required></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field-row ah-admin-two-columns"><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-start">开始时间</label><input id="volunteer-shift-start" name="start" type="time" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-end">结束时间</label><input id="volunteer-shift-end" name="end" type="time" required /></div></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-required">所需人手（本班次人次）</label><input id="volunteer-shift-required" name="required" type="number" min="1" max="300" step="1" required /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-session">关联活动场次（选填）</label><select id="volunteer-shift-session" name="sessionId"></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-booth">关联展位（选填）</label><select id="volunteer-shift-booth" name="boothId"></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-shift-status">班次状态</label><select id="volunteer-shift-status" name="status"><option value="active">使用中</option><option value="cancelled">已取消，保留历史</option></select></div><p class="volunteer-form-state" data-volunteer-shift-dirty role="status">修改后请保存到云端。</p><div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="shift">关闭</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">保存</button></div></form></dialog>
  <dialog class="ah-admin-dialog volunteer-dialog" data-volunteer-assignment-dialog aria-labelledby="volunteer-assignment-title"><div class="ah-admin-dialog-heading"><h2 id="volunteer-assignment-title">安排志愿者</h2><button class="ah-admin-icon-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="assignment" aria-label="关闭排班编辑">×</button></div><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-volunteer-assignment-error role="alert" hidden></p><form data-volunteer-assignment-form><input name="id" type="hidden" /><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-assignment-person">志愿者</label><select id="volunteer-assignment-person" name="volunteerId" required></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-assignment-shift">岗位班次</label><select id="volunteer-assignment-shift" name="shiftId" required></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="volunteer-assignment-status">安排状态</label><select id="volunteer-assignment-status" name="status"><option value="proposed">拟安排，尚未确认</option><option value="confirmed">已确认本班次</option><option value="cancelled">已取消，保留历史</option></select><small>确认排班须有本人协作答应及已确认参会名额；系统还会检查可服务时间、重叠班次和需求人数。</small></div><p class="volunteer-note">已有安排的人员与班次固定。需要换人或换班时，先取消原安排，再新增一项，保留记录。</p><p class="volunteer-form-state" data-volunteer-assignment-dirty role="status">修改后请保存到云端。</p><div class="ah-admin-dialog-actions"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-volunteer-close="assignment">关闭</button><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">保存</button></div></form></dialog>
  <script>import '../../../scripts/volunteers.mjs';</script>
</SiteLayout>
